# Local brick copies stay out of the repository.
#
# Every lesson carries its own copy of the SunFounder bricks under bricks/,
# and the speech bricks ship a 72 MB Whisper model each. That is roughly
# 950 MB of duplicated binaries across the lessons, so the copies are kept
# on the machine and shipped inside the lesson zips instead.
bricks/

# Lesson packages are published as release attachments, not as commits:
# each zip is about 95 MB, and every revision would add that much to the
# history of the repository for good.
*.zip

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
